    "checked_cases": [
      "An actual append limit starts a filtered copy with an immutable native view, retaining the old lookup path.",
      "The planner waits without catalog I/O or charge until sufficient new committed input exists.",
      "Further native writes do not restart the plan. The resulting catalog keeps unchanged live features, drops stale postings and can accept another update.",
      "The paired journal advances before candidate writes. A torn charge prevents all candidate writes.",
      "Failures at the first write and final barrier keep the old selected catalog and retain the durable write charge.",
      "The Windows memory provider retains both areas through rotation and frees the old address reservation and locked pages.",
      "Independent CPU readers verify exact acknowledged file contents, including concurrent foreground input."
    ],
